      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p class="article-subtitle">
        A decision that was valid yesterday may no longer authorize an AI-initiated action today.
      </p>
      <p class="article-meta">By BeaconGuard · September 16, 2026</p>
      <figure class="article-featured">
        <img
          src={featuredImage}
          alt="Split scene: qualified researcher authorized vs qualification changed access denied; same capability different consequences."
          width="1448"
